 "description": "<p>Warmth is the upgrade here. Five minutes after switching on, the shaft reaches a constant holding temperature, and heat changes everything layered on top of it — the ten vibration frequencies read softer, the stimulating beads along the body land with more presence, and the whole session starts already comfortable instead of working up from cold silicone.</p>\n<p><img alt=\"rose toy clit sucker vibrator red\" src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0772/6311/0453/files/rosetoyclitsuckervibratorred_9_a91ed424-9b96-458a-9864-cde6ae0486a1_480x480.jpg?v=1689748503\"></p>\n<p>Efficiency is the quieter spec: the heating system draws about thirty percent less power than the typical approach, which is why a single USB charge still returns an hour and a half of play despite running a heater and a motor at once.</p>\n<p><img alt=\"rose toy clit sucker vibrator red\" src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0772/6311/0453/files/rosetoyclitsuckervibratorred_2_5a8780eb-dec9-454b-8d2f-f4e71f8375ce_480x480.jpg?v=1689748487\"></p>\n<p>The body is medical-grade silicone with an IPX6 rating, so cleanup is a rinse rather than a procedure. At 50 dB or under, the motor stays in background-noise territory — a television in the next room covers it fully.</p>\n<p><img alt=\"rose toy clit sucker vibrator red\" src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0772/6311/0453/files/rosetoyclitsuckervibratorred_6_a0faf036-fe68-4582-80e3-4aa50b967dc1_480x480.jpg?v=1689748494\"></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Heating: 5-minute warm-up, constant temperature</li>\n<li>Modes: 10 vibration frequencies with stimulating beads</li>\n<li>Material: medical-grade silicone</li>\n<li>Battery: USB rechargeable, 1.5 hours of play</li>\n<li>Noise: 50 dB or lower; waterproof IPX6</li>\n</ul>\n<p><img alt=\"rose toy clit sucker vibrator red\" src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0772/6311/0453/files/rosetoyclitsuckervibratorred_8_96c28ef6-19a3-4fd3-b8b9-34463e0632b8_480x480.jpg?v=1689748500\"><br />\n<img alt=\"rose toy clit sucker vibrator red\" src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0772/6311/0453/files/rosetoyclitsuckervibratorred_7_ea30db5b-621c-4106-887b-3d2a6dfc3365_480x480.jpg?v=1689748497\"><br />\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0772/6311/0453/files/rosetoyclitsuckervibratorred_1_84b13639-483f-49cd-9e72-528e4c3b52ac_480x480.jpg?v=1689748484\" alt=\"rose toy clit sucker vibrator red\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\"></p>\n<p>For users who have everything except the warmth, this is the missing variable.</p>\n",
